cockpit-sharehub (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Containers: detect LXC/Docker; NFS is marked unsupported and cannot
    be enabled where the kernel NFS server is unavailable.
  * WS-Discovery works with wsdd-server or wsdd2 (Debian 13 ships wsdd2).
  * Components dashboard: packages missing from the package sources are
    shown as "Not available" with guidance instead of an Install button.

 -- Andrei Prajina <ancyent@xserv.ro>  Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0200

